{"seq":1,"slug":"list-processing-recursion","title":"列表处理与递归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/list-processing-recursion","wordCount":1244,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"列表处理与递归\">列表处理与递归</h1><p>列表是 Prolog 中最基本、使用最频繁的数据结构。由于 Prolog 没有循环语句，所有对列表的操作都通过<strong>递归</strong>实现——一个基础情况处理空列表，一个递归情况将问题分解为头元素和尾列表。掌握列表递归的模式，就掌握了 Prolog 编程的核心手艺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>列表递归的要点可以概括为以下几组概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>列表的内部表示</strong>：<code>[H|T]</code> 是 <code>&#39;.&#39;(H, T)</code> 的语法糖，本质是右递归的二叉树，解构完全依靠合一；</li>\n<li><strong>递归的两个要素</strong>：基础情况（终止条件）与递归情况（问题分解），两者缺一不可；</li>\n<li><strong>累加器模式</strong>：用额外参数向下传递中间结果，使尾递归优化成为可能，把栈空间从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li><strong>差异列表</strong>：以「列表 - 尾部」的对表示部分列表，把 <code>append</code> 的拼接从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li><strong>不完全列表</strong>：尾部保持未绑定，用于增量构造与流式处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素递归</td>\n<td>结构直观</td>\n<td>非尾递归，栈随深度增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累加器</td>\n<td>常数栈空间</td>\n<td>需要多一个参数与包装谓词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异列表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 拼接</td>\n<td>表示不直观，调试较难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高阶谓词</td>\n<td>消除重复的遍历代码</td>\n<td>引入 <code>call/N</code> 的调用开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"列表的内部表示\">列表的内部表示</h2><p>Prolog 列表是右递归的链式结构，用 <code>&#39;.&#39;(Head, Tail)</code> 函子构建（在现代语法中写作 <code>[Head|Tail]</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 以下三种写法等价&#10;[a, b, c]&#10;[a | [b, c]]&#10;[a | [b | [c | []]]]&#10;&#39;.&#39;(a, &#39;.&#39;(b, &#39;.&#39;(c, [])))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 以下三种写法等价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[a, b, c]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[a | [b, c]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[a | [b | [c | []]]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>'.'(a, '.'(b, '.'(c, [])))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>列表的解构通过合一完成——<code>[H|T]</code> 模式将列表的头与尾分别绑定到 H 和 T：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列表</th>\n<th>模式 <code>[H|T]</code> 匹配</th>\n<th>H</th>\n<th>T</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>[a, b, c]</code></td>\n<td>成功</td>\n<td><code>a</code></td>\n<td><code>[b, c]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[x]</code></td>\n<td>成功</td>\n<td><code>x</code></td>\n<td><code>[]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[]</code></td>\n<td>失败</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基本递归模式\">基本递归模式</h2><p>几乎所有列表操作都遵循两种模式之一：<strong>遍历</strong>（处理每个元素）和<strong>构造</strong>（从基础情况向上积累结果）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式一-遍历累积\">模式一：遍历累积</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 列表长度&#10;length_of([], 0).&#10;length_of([_|T], N) :-&#10;    length_of(T, N1),&#10;    N is N1 + 1.&#10;&#10;%% 列表求和&#10;sum_list([], 0).&#10;sum_list([H|T], Sum) :-&#10;    sum_list(T, Rest),&#10;    Sum is H + Rest.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 列表长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>length_of([], 0).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>length_of([_|T], N) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    length_of(T, N1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N is N1 + 1.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 列表求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum_list([], 0).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum_list([H|T], Sum) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum_list(T, Rest),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Sum is H + Rest.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式二-尾递归累加器\">模式二：尾递归累加器</h3><p>朴素递归在回溯时需要保持调用栈；累加器模式将中间结果通过额外参数向下传递，使尾递归优化成为可能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 尾递归版本——常数栈空间&#10;length_acc(List, N) :- length_acc(List, 0, N).&#10;length_acc([], Acc, Acc).&#10;length_acc([_|T], Acc, N) :-&#10;    Acc1 is Acc + 1,&#10;    length_acc(T, Acc1, N).&#10;&#10;%% 尾递归求和&#10;sum_acc(List, Sum) :- sum_acc(List, 0, Sum).&#10;sum_acc([], Acc, Acc).&#10;sum_acc([H|T], Acc, Sum) :-&#10;    Acc1 is Acc + H,&#10;    sum_acc(T, Acc1, Sum).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 尾递归版本——常数栈空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>length_acc(List, N) :- length_acc(List, 0, N).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>length_acc([], Acc, Acc).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>length_acc([_|T], Acc, N) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Acc1 is Acc + 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    length_acc(T, Acc1, N).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 尾递归求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum_acc(List, Sum) :- sum_acc(List, 0, Sum).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum_acc([], Acc, Acc).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum_acc([H|T], Acc, Sum) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Acc1 is Acc + H,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum_acc(T, Acc1, Sum).</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph S1[&quot;朴素递归 (栈增长)&quot;]&#10;    A1[sum([1,2,3], S)&quot;] --&gt; A2[sum([2,3], S1)&quot;]&#10;    A2 --&gt; A3[sum([3], S2)&quot;]&#10;    A3 --&gt; A4[sum([], 0)&quot;]&#10;    A4 --&gt;|&quot;回溯 S2=3&quot;| A3&#10;    A3 --&gt;|&quot;回溯 S1=5&quot;| A2&#10;    A2 --&gt;|&quot;回溯 S=6&quot;| A1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph S2[&quot;累加器 (尾递归)&quot;]&#10;    B1[sum_acc([1,2,3], 0, S)&quot;] --&gt; B2[sum_acc([2,3], 1, S)&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[sum_acc([3], 3, S)&quot;]&#10;    B3 --&gt; B4[sum_acc([], 6, 6)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph S1[\"朴素递归 (栈增长)\"]\n    A1[sum([1,2,3], S)\"] --&gt; A2[sum([2,3], S1)\"]\n    A2 --&gt; A3[sum([3], S2)\"]\n    A3 --&gt; A4[sum([], 0)\"]\n    A4 --&gt;|\"回溯 S2=3\"| A3\n    A3 --&gt;|\"回溯 S1=5\"| A2\n    A2 --&gt;|\"回溯 S=6\"| A1\n    end\n    subgraph S2[\"累加器 (尾递归)\"]\n    B1[sum_acc([1,2,3], 0, S)\"] --&gt; B2[sum_acc([2,3], 1, S)\"]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[sum_acc([3], 3, S)\"]\n    B3 --&gt; B4[sum_acc([], 6, 6)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心列表谓词\">核心列表谓词</h2><h3 id=\"append-3-列表拼接的多用途工具\">append/3——列表拼接的多用途工具</h3><p><code>append/3</code> 是 Prolog 最经典的谓词之一，展现了合一的双向性（详见<a href=\"../foundations/unification-resolution\">合一与归结原理</a>中关于双向性的讨论）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"append([], L, L).&#10;append([H|T], L, [H|R]) :- append(T, L, R).&#10;&#10;%% 四种使用方式&#10;?- append([1,2], [3,4], X).       % 拼接&#10;?- append(X, [3,4], [1,2,3,4]).   % 求前缀&#10;?- append([1,2], X, [1,2,3,4]).   % 求后缀&#10;?- append(X, Y, [1,2,3]).         % 枚举所有分割\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>append([], L, L).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>append([H|T], L, [H|R]) :- append(T, L, R).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 四种使用方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append([1,2], [3,4], X).       % 拼接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append(X, [3,4], [1,2,3,4]).   % 求前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append([1,2], X, [1,2,3,4]).   % 求后缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- append(X, Y, [1,2,3]).         % 枚举所有分割</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"member-2-成员检测与生成\">member/2——成员检测与生成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"member(X, [X|_]).&#10;member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).&#10;&#10;%% 检测模式&#10;?- member(3, [1,2,3,4]).   % true&#10;&#10;%% 生成模式&#10;?- member(X, [a,b,c]).     % X = a ; X = b ; X = c\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [X|_]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 检测模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- member(3, [1,2,3,4]).   % true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 生成模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- member(X, [a,b,c]).     % X = a ; X = b ; X = c</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reverse-2-列表反转\">reverse/2——列表反转</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 朴素版本 O(n^2)——每次 append 遍历整个累积列表&#10;reverse_naive([], []).&#10;reverse_naive([H|T], R) :-&#10;    reverse_naive(T, RT),&#10;    append(RT, [H], R).&#10;&#10;%% 累加器版本 O(n)——差异列表技巧&#10;reverse(List, Rev) :- reverse(List, [], Rev).&#10;reverse([], Acc, Acc).&#10;reverse([H|T], Acc, Rev) :- reverse(T, [H|Acc], Rev).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 朴素版本 O(n^2)——每次 append 遍历整个累积列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reverse_naive([], []).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reverse_naive([H|T], R) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    reverse_naive(T, RT),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(RT, [H], R).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 累加器版本 O(n)——差异列表技巧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reverse(List, Rev) :- reverse(List, [], Rev).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reverse([], Acc, Acc).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reverse([H|T], Acc, Rev) :- reverse(T, [H|Acc], Rev).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高阶列表操作\">高阶列表操作</h2><p>Prolog 通过 <code>call/N</code> 和 lambda 表达式支持高阶编程。<code>maplist</code>、<code>include</code>、<code>foldl</code> 等谓词将通用的遍历模式抽象出来：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% maplist：对每个元素应用谓词&#10;?- maplist([X]&gt;&gt;(Y is X*X), [1,2,3,4], Squares).&#10;Squares = [1, 4, 9, 16].&#10;&#10;%% include：过滤满足条件的元素&#10;positive(X) :- X &gt; 0.&#10;?- include(positive, [-1, 2, -3, 4], Pos).&#10;Pos = [2, 4].&#10;&#10;%% foldl：左折叠累积&#10;?- foldl([X, Acc, Res]&gt;&gt;(Res is Acc + X), [1,2,3,4], 0, Sum).&#10;Sum = 10.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% maplist：对每个元素应用谓词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- maplist([X]>>(Y is X*X), [1,2,3,4], Squares).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Squares = [1, 4, 9, 16].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% include：过滤满足条件的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>positive(X) :- X > 0.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- include(positive, [-1, 2, -3, 4], Pos).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Pos = [2, 4].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% foldl：左折叠累积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- foldl([X, Acc, Res]>>(Res is Acc + X), [1,2,3,4], 0, Sum).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sum = 10.</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谓词</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>对应函数式概念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>maplist/3</code></td>\n<td>对每个元素应用变换</td>\n<td><code>map</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>include/3</code></td>\n<td>保留满足条件的元素</td>\n<td><code>filter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exclude/3</code></td>\n<td>移除满足条件的元素</td>\n<td><code>reject</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>foldl/4</code></td>\n<td>从左到右累积</td>\n<td><code>foldl</code>/<code>reduce</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>msort/2</code></td>\n<td>归并排序（保留重复）</td>\n<td><code>sort</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"差异列表-o-1-拼接\">差异列表：O(1) 拼接</h2><p>差异列表用「列表 - 尾部」的对来表示部分列表，使得拼接操作从 O(n) 降为 O(1)：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 差异列表表示 [a,b,c]：pair [a,b,c|T]-T&#10;%% 拼接只需合一尾部指针&#10;dl_append(X-Y, Y-Z, X-Z).&#10;&#10;?- dl_append([a,b|T1]-T1, [c,d|T2]-T2, Result).&#10;Result = [a,b,c,d|T2]-T2.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 差异列表表示 [a,b,c]：pair [a,b,c|T]-T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 拼接只需合一尾部指针</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dl_append(X-Y, Y-Z, X-Z).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- dl_append([a,b|T1]-T1, [c,d|T2]-T2, Result).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Result = [a,b,c,d|T2]-T2.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个技术在 <a href=\"dcg-parsing\">DCG 与语法解析</a>中被系统化运用——DCG 规则的编译结果本质上就是差异列表操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"列表与算术-生成-测试模式\">列表与算术：生成-测试模式</h2><p>Prolog 的非确定性搜索天然适合生成-测试（generate-and-test）模式：先通过回溯生成候选解，再用条件过滤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 找出列表中所有偶数&#10;even_members(List, Evens) :-&#10;    findall(X, (member(X, List), X mod 2 =:= 0), Evens).&#10;&#10;%% 排列生成&#10;permutation([], []).&#10;permutation(List, [H|Perm]) :-&#10;    select(H, List, Rest),&#10;    permutation(Rest, Perm).&#10;&#10;%% 组合生成&#10;combination(0, _, []).&#10;combination(N, [H|T], [H|Comb]) :-&#10;    N &gt; 0, N1 is N - 1,&#10;    combination(N1, T, Comb).&#10;combination(N, [_|T], Comb) :-&#10;    N &gt; 0,&#10;    combination(N, T, Comb).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 找出列表中所有偶数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>even_members(List, Evens) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    findall(X, (member(X, List), X mod 2 =:= 0), Evens).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 排列生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>permutation([], []).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>permutation(List, [H|Perm]) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    select(H, List, Rest),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permutation(Rest, Perm).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 组合生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>combination(0, _, []).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>combination(N, [H|T], [H|Comb]) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N > 0, N1 is N - 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    combination(N1, T, Comb).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>combination(N, [_|T], Comb) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N > 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    combination(N, T, Comb).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"不完全列表与惰性生成\">不完全列表与惰性生成</h2><p>Prolog 的合一允许列表尾部保持未绑定，形成<strong>不完全列表</strong>（open list）。这可以实现类似惰性求值的效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 不完全列表——尾部是自由变量&#10;?- X = [1, 2, 3 | Tail].&#10;X = [1, 2, 3|Tail].  % Tail 尚未绑定&#10;&#10;%% 逐步填充&#10;?- X = [1, 2, 3 | Tail], Tail = [4, 5 | Rest].&#10;X = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5|Rest].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 不完全列表——尾部是自由变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X = [1, 2, 3 | Tail].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = [1, 2, 3|Tail].  % Tail 尚未绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 逐步填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X = [1, 2, 3 | Tail], Tail = [4, 5 | Rest].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5|Rest].</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不完全列表是 Prolog 实现消息队列、增量构造和流处理的基础。在约束逻辑编程中（见<a href=\"constraint-logic-programming\">约束逻辑编程</a>），约束存储本身就常用不完全列表来实现增量添加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能考量\">性能考量</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>优化建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>[H|T]</code> 分解</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>列表头访问极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>append/3</code> 拼接</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 第一参数长度</td>\n<td>用差异列表降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>length/2</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无法优化，需遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nth0/3</code> 随机访问</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需要随机访问时改用 <code>arg/3</code> 操作复合项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>last/2</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>考虑是否能用反向列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>msort/2</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>标准归并排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>列表处理是 Prolog 编程的基本功，本文的核心可归纳为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列表是右递归的链式结构，<code>[H|T]</code> 模式通过合一完成解构；</li>\n<li>一切列表操作都遵循「基础情况 + 递归情况」的骨架，这是没有循环语句的语言中最自然的迭代形式；</li>\n<li>累加器模式把递归改写为尾递归，将栈空间从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是性能敏感代码的默认选择；</li>\n<li>差异列表以「列表 - 尾部」对表示部分列表，使拼接达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，也是 DCG 的底层机制；</li>\n<li><code>maplist</code>/<code>include</code>/<code>foldl</code> 等高阶谓词把遍历模式抽象出来，可显著减少样板代码；</li>\n<li>不完全列表支持增量构造，是消息队列与流处理的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步可以阅读 <a href=\"dcg-parsing\">DCG 与语法解析</a>，看差异列表如何被系统化为文法解析工具；或阅读<a href=\"constraint-logic-programming\">约束逻辑编程</a>，了解如何用约束替代「生成-测试」的低效搜索。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列表处理与递归","id":"列表处理与递归"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"列表的内部表示","id":"列表的内部表示"},{"level":2,"text":"基本递归模式","id":"基本递归模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：遍历累积","id":"模式一-遍历累积"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：尾递归累加器","id":"模式二-尾递归累加器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心列表谓词","id":"核心列表谓词"},{"level":3,"text":"append/3——列表拼接的多用途工具","id":"append-3-列表拼接的多用途工具"},{"level":3,"text":"member/2——成员检测与生成","id":"member-2-成员检测与生成"},{"level":3,"text":"reverse/2——列表反转","id":"reverse-2-列表反转"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶列表操作","id":"高阶列表操作"},{"level":2,"text":"差异列表：O(1) 拼接","id":"差异列表-o-1-拼接"},{"level":2,"text":"列表与算术：生成-测试模式","id":"列表与算术-生成-测试模式"},{"level":2,"text":"不完全列表与惰性生成","id":"不完全列表与惰性生成"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量","id":"性能考量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索策略与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/search-strategies-cut"},"next":{"title":"DCG 与语法解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/dcg-parsing"}}